@startuml Search Products - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "SearchController" as SearchCtrl
participant "Product" as Product
participant "Category" as Category
participant "View" as View

== Search ==
User -> SearchCtrl: results(request)
SearchCtrl -> Product: where(name, LIKE, query)
Product --> SearchCtrl: products
SearchCtrl -> Category: where(name, LIKE, query)
Category --> SearchCtrl: categories
SearchCtrl -> View: show search.results(products, categories, query)
View --> User: display search results

== Quick Suggestions ==
User -> SearchCtrl: suggestions(request)
SearchCtrl -> Product: where(name, LIKE, query)->limit(5)
Product --> SearchCtrl: suggestions
SearchCtrl -> View: return JSON(suggestions)
View --> User: display suggestions dropdown

@enduml
